---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms & Conditions | Word & Character Counter"
	description="Read our Terms and Conditions for using the Word & Character Counter tool."
>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 w-full">
		<header class="mb-16 text-center">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Terms & Conditions</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">Effective Date: June 9, 2026</p>
		</header>

		<div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
				<p>
					By accessing and using <strong>Word & Character Counter</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use the tool.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Use of the Service</h2>
				<p>
					Our tool is provided for personal and professional use to analyze text. You agree not to use the service for any unlawful activities or to interfere with the proper functioning of the site.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. No Warranties</h2>
				<p>
					This service is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. While we strive for 100% accuracy, we do not guarantee that the metrics provided (word count, character count, time estimates) will always be error-free. We are not liable for any decisions made based on the data provided by our tool.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
				<p>
					The design, code, and branding of Word & Character Counter are the intellectual property of the site owners. You may not reproduce, distribute, or modify any part of the site without prior written consent. The text you enter into the tool remains your sole property.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p>
					In no event shall Word & Character Counter be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising out of your use or inability to use the service.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
				<p>
					We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the site following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
